CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bj com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/ProjectileSpawnGeoIndex
	COMMENT Shared UnitSearchRequest used by ProjectileList when spawning projectiles: sourceWorld (the world the spawn came from, also the unit used as the geo-query source), entry (the ProjectileSpawnEntry being spawned), sourceUnit, targetWorld and targetUnit. All callbacks are no-ops (excludeTeam -2, no team filters); the values are only carried for the spawn call. [field names verified from code]
	FIELD a sourceWorld Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/f;
	FIELD b entry Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bk;
	FIELD c sourceUnit Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;
	FIELD d targetWorld Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/f;
	FIELD e targetUnit Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;
